  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The Camera class manages the core rendering view by calculating the projection and view matrices. It encapsulates camera parameters like field of view, aspect ratio, and clipping planes, supporting both perspective and orthographic projections. It provides essential geometric utilities such as converting world coordinates to screen space and vice versa, crucial for raycasting and picking operations within the 3D scene graph."
  },
